/M AND W OPTION PROCESSOR.
/M OPTION PUNCHES LEGIBLE DATE (IF ANY)
/W OPTION PUNCHES LEGIBLE MESSAGE CONTAINED IN 1ST
/INPUT FILE (IF ANY), AND SIPHONS THE REST OF THE FILES
/DOWN, THEN CALLS THE 'LEADER' ROUTINE BEFORE RETURNING.

